  "title": "SX1 Braid",
  "description": "<p>Developed with input from Brent Ehrler and Aaron Martens. They have used several generations of this line to reach this product. ULT-PE material for great improvement of abrasion resistance, which was the weak point of PE lines. Retains the suppleness of PE for stress free casting. Sleek finish to reduce guide friction and improved casting distance. Neutral buoyancy. Martens and Ehrler both wanted a neutral buoyancy for optimum bait performance. Does not use a resin coating to compensate for fray or slickness, the raw fiber has been improved.</p>\n<p><strong>Spool Length | Color | LB Test </strong></p>\n<p>125 YD | Dark Green | 10, 12, 16, 20, 30, 40, 50<br>125 YD | Hi-Vis Yellow | 12, 16</p>\n<p>250 YD | Dark Green | 10, 12, 16, 20, 30, 40, 50</p>\n<p>600 YD | Dark Green | 8, 10, 12, 16, 20, 30, 40, 50<br>600 YD | Hi-Vis Yellow | 8, 10, 12, 16</p>\n<p><strong>Standard Dia. (inch / mm)</strong></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0532/9777/4771/files/Dia_SX1.jpg?v=1744599957\"></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0532/9777/4771/files/warning_71f1a8fd-822f-4db4-a792-773b6cf9fd83.jpg?v=1615500049\"></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>CALIFORNIA PROPOSITION 65<br>WARNING: </strong><span>These products can expose you to chemicals including lead or DINP, which is known to the state of California to cause cancer and birth defects or other reproductive harm. For more information go to </span><a href=\"http://www.p65warnings.ca.gov/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">P65Warnings.ca.gov</a></p>\n<p> </p>",
  "descriptionText": "Developed with input from Brent Ehrler and Aaron Martens. They have used several generations of this line to reach this product. ULT-PE material for great improvement of abrasion resistance, which was the weak point of PE lines. Retains the suppleness of PE for stress free casting. Sleek finish to reduce guide friction and improved casting distance. Neutral buoyancy. Martens and Ehrler both wanted a neutral buoyancy for optimum bait performance. Does not use a resin coating to compensate for fray or slickness, the raw fiber has been improved. Spool Length | Color | LB Test 125 YD | Dark Green | 10, 12, 16, 20, 30, 40, 50 125 YD | Hi-Vis Yellow | 12, 16 250 YD | Dark Green | 10, 12, 16, 20, 30, 40, 50 600 YD | Dark Green | 8, 10, 12, 16, 20, 30, 40, 50 600 YD | Hi-Vis Yellow | 8, 10, 12, 16 Standard Dia. (inch / mm) CALIFORNIA PROPOSITION 65 WARNING: These products can expose you to chemicals including lead or DINP, which is known to the state of California to cause cancer and birth defects or other reproductive harm. For more information go to P65Warnings.ca.gov",
